msgctxt "function:project-tree"
msgid "Show or hide the tree of the files of the project in the side bar."
msgstr ""

#: lisp/window.scm
msgctxt "function:project-tree-focus"
msgid ""
"Show the project tree in the side bar if it is hidden, and move the focus to it.\n"
"In the tree, n and p move, RET opens, f and b open and close a directory,\n"
"g reads again, and q or C-g returns to the editor."
msgstr ""

#: lisp/winner.scm
