"characters in the accessible portion of the current buffer, use\n"
"`(- (point-max) (point-min))', and to count the number of characters\n"
"in the accessible portion of some other BUFFER, use\n"
"`(with-current-buffer BUFFER (- (point-max) (point-min)))'."
msgstr ""

#: core/src/scheme/emacs_docs.rs
msgctxt "function:buffer-string"
msgid ""
